### ============================================================
### Usages
### POST membuat Usage + StockMovement out_usage otomatis
### verify/reject = laboran only, method PATCH
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@token = {{token}}
@usageId = 1
@itemId = 5

### List usages
GET {{baseUrl}}/usages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter status dicatat
GET {{baseUrl}}/usages?status=dicatat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter status diverifikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/usages?status=diverifikasi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter by item
GET {{baseUrl}}/usages?item_id={{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nested — usages for item
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/{{itemId}}/usages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Show usage
GET {{baseUrl}}/usages/{{usageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create usage
# @name createUsage
POST {{baseUrl}}/usages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item_id": {{itemId}},
  "quantity_used": 5.5,
  "purpose": "Pemakaian uji via kulala"
}

### Verify usage (admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/usages/{{usageId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reject usage (admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/usages/{{usageId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rejection_reason": "Kuantitas tidak sesuai catatan lab"
}
